Package: nushell
Architecture: amd64 arm64 armhf riscv64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Description: modern shell operating on structured data
 Nushell (nu) is a new type of shell: pipelines carry structured, typed data
 instead of raw text, with first-class support for JSON, YAML, CSV, TOML,
 SQLite and more. Includes the official plugins (formats, gstat, inc, polars,
 query) and registers nu in /etc/shells so it can be used as a login shell.
